  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 11-month project aims to improve access to vaccines and routine immunization for the most vulnerable and underserved communities, such as migrant returnees, Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs), nomadic and affected host communities and thereby contribute to reducing the morbidity and mortality of children associated with Vaccine-Preventable Diseases (VPDs) in Afghanistan.</narrative>
  </description>
